  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the milk and half the butter to potato and season with salt. Mash until smooth.\n• TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688710721cc5cea712803adc/step-95bd2100.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, preheat grill to high.\n• Thinly slice leek and celery.\n• Thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.\n• In a large frying pan, melt the remaining butter with a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook leek, celery and carrot, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add cannellini beans and garlic & herb seasoning and cook stirring, until slightly tender and fragrant, 2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688710721cc5cea712803adc/step-63c27e10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium, then stir in light cooking cream, the water and salt, until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove from heat, then add half the Parmesan cheese, stirring, until combined. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688710721cc5cea712803adc/step-ddaa8d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer bean filling into a baking dish and evenly spread mashed potato over the top. Sprinkle with remaining Parmesan cheese.\n• Grill pie, until lightly golden, 8-10 minutes.\n• TIP: Grills cook fast, so keep an eye on the pie!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688710721cc5cea712803adc/step-d48aa630.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Add mixed salad leaves and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688710721cc5cea712803adc/step-2b90cc40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rustic cannellini bean and leek pie between plates. Serve with salad. Enjoy!\n• TIP: Keeping a portion for later? See storage and re-heating instructions under allergens!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688710721cc5cea712803adc/step-86f63e50.jpg"
    }
  ]
